                 compute(2)           compute(0)

             1 전달
                       -1 전달     -1 반환
                   1 반환

     compute(1)           compute(-1)

  class Child extends Parent {
          int compute(int num) {
  ❽              if(num <= 1) return num;
  ❾⓫            return compute(num - 1) + compute(num - 3);
